nodes.body:
@codex review

PTAL at `4978d435`. Frame-budget validation now runs over the shared grids before owner encoding or collectives. The CPU repro showed the old owner rejecting a 4-frame item under cap 3 while an empty peer entered broadcast; both now reject first.

The regression executes the actual K3 method and DP helper with real CPU Torch and mocked runtime/groups. Existing grouping/order checks pass; real multi-GPU collectives and tower numerics remain unverified. No change to valid grouping or the disabled default.

